# Native deps whose install scripts MUST run (better-sqlite3 fetches its
# prebuilt binary via prebuild-install; without it the API crashes at startup
# with "Could not locate the bindings file").
#
# Declared at the project level so a user-level pnpm rc that restricts
# only-built-dependencies (a common leftover of `pnpm approve-builds` in other
# projects) cannot silently skip these builds — project .npmrc takes precedence
# over the user rc, which the package.json field alone does not.
# KEEP IN SYNC with package.json `pnpm.onlyBuiltDependencies` (read by pnpm 9
# and 10 alike): a native dep added to one list but not the other reproduces
# the "Could not locate the bindings file" crash.
only-built-dependencies[]=better-sqlite3
only-built-dependencies[]=esbuild
